<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DecisionOne upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DecisionOne upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has raised its rating on DecisionOne Corp to buy from outperform, a source at the firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- The computer maintenance company's stock closed at 13-7/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
